 "remarks": "Tucked away in a private, idyllic setting surrounded by nature, this beautifully updated one-bedroom cottage offers a peaceful retreat with exceptional charm and comfort. Thoughtfully designed with a wonderful floorplan, the home features effortless indoor-outdoor living, with easy access to a private deck-perfect for relaxing and enjoying the tranquil surroundings. The inviting kitchen is appointed with newer appliances and a convenient pantry, offering both style and functionality. The sun-filled living room is a standout, featuring soaring vaulted ceilings, exposed beams, a cozy fireplace, and an abundance of windows that fill the space with beautiful natural light. All new windows throughout. Completely updated and presented in beautiful condition, this charming cottage offers a wonderful blend of privacy, comfort, and character. Plenty of parking adds to the convenience, making this a truly special rental opportunity. Option to rent furnished. Inquire with agent.",
